[
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "烛之武退秦师 <sup>a</sup>"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                473,
                117,
                712,
                149
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "《左传》"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                554,
                166,
                631,
                187
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "晋侯、秦伯<sup>b</sup> 围郑，以其无礼于晋<sup>c</sup>，且贰于楚<sup>d</sup> 也。晋军函 陵<sup>e</sup>，秦军氾南<sup>f</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                295,
                234,
                889,
                277
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "佚之狐<sup>g</sup> 言于郑伯<sup>h</sup> 曰：“国危矣，若使烛之武见秦君，师必退。”公从之。辞曰：“臣之壮<sup>i</sup> 也，犹<sup>j</sup> 不如人；今老矣，无能为也已<sup>k</sup>。”公曰：“吾不能早用子，今急而求子，是寡人之过也。然郑亡，子亦有不利焉。”许<sup>l</sup> 之。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                294,
                280,
                890,
                367
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/1a8fe968464abf6f271227264a525d75462ff01e84963e8be383f5f26e8825ab.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "春秋列国形势简图（前630年）"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                300,
                372,
                887,
                717
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "郑国地名，在今河南新郑北。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                541,
                755,
                742,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "f﹝氾（fán）南〕氾水的南面，也属郑地。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                771,
                818,
                788
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g﹝佚（yì）之狐〕郑国大夫。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                788,
                731,
                803
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h﹝郑伯〕指郑文公（？—前628），名捷，郑国国君。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                803,
                877,
                820
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i﹝壮〕壮年。古时男子三十为“壮”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                820,
                796,
                835
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j﹝犹〕尚且。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                835,
                631,
                851
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                297,
                70,
                331,
                98
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a 节选自《左传·僖公三十年》（《春秋左传注》，中华书局1990年版）。题目是编者加的。烛之武，郑国大夫。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                755,
                468,
                803
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b﹝晋侯、秦伯〕指晋文公和秦穆公。秦穆公（？—前621），名任好，秦国国君，春秋五霸之一。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                803,
                468,
                835
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "c﹝无礼于晋〕指晋文公早年出亡经过郑国时，郑国没有以应有的礼遇对待他。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                835,
                467,
                868
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "k﹝无能为也已〕不能干什么了。也已，语气助词，表示确定。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                517,
                851,
                889,
                883
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l﹝许〕答应。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                883,
                630,
                901
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d﹝贰于楚〕指郑国依附于晋的同时又亲附于楚。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                868,
                433,
                884
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e﹝晋军函陵〕晋军驻扎在函陵。军，驻扎。函陵，"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                884,
                465,
                901
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "10"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                97,
                940,
                122,
                953
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "语文 必修下册"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                136,
                938,
                247,
                954
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "夜缒<sup>a</sup> 而出，见秦伯，曰：“秦、晋围郑，郑既<sup>b</sup>知亡矣。若亡 郑而有益于君，敢以烦执事<sup>c</sup>。越国以鄙远<sup>d</sup>，君知其难也，焉用 亡郑以陪邻<sup>e</sup> ？邻之厚，君之薄也<sup>f</sup>。若舍郑以为东道主<sup>g</sup>，行 李<sup>h</sup> 之往来，共其乏困<sup>i</sup>，君亦无所害。且君尝为晋君赐矣<sup>j</sup>， 许君焦、瑕<sup>k</sup>，朝济而夕设版焉<sup>l</sup>，君之所知也。夫晋，何厌之 有？既东封郑<sup>m</sup>，又欲肆其西封<sup>n</sup>，若不阙秦<sup>o</sup>，将焉取之<sup>p</sup> ？阙 秦以利晋，唯君图之<sup>q</sup>。”秦伯说，与郑人盟。使杞子、逢孙、杨 孙<sup>r</sup> 戍之，乃还。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                104,
                67,
                704,
                246
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "子犯<sup>s</sup> 请击之。公<sup>t</sup> 曰：“不可。微夫人之力不及此<sup>u</sup>。因人之力而敝之，不仁<sup>v</sup> ；失其所与，不知<sup>w</sup> ；以乱易整，不武<sup>x</sup>。吾其还也<sup>y</sup>。”亦去之。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                248,
                702,
                313
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a〔缒（zhuì）〕用绳子拴着人（或物）从上往下送。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                498,
                463,
                514
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b〔既〕已经。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                107,
                514,
                220,
                530
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "c〔敢以烦执事〕冒昧地用（亡郑这件事）麻烦您。敢，自言冒昧的谦辞。执事，办事的官员，代指对方（秦穆公），表示恭敬。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                531,
                478,
                579
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d〔越国以鄙远〕越过别国而把远地当作边邑。国，指晋国，地处秦、郑之间。鄙，边邑，这里用作动词。远，指郑国。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                579,
                478,
                626
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e〔焉用亡郑以陪邻〕哪里用得着灭掉郑国而给邻国增加土地呢？陪，增加。邻，邻国，指晋国。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                626,
                478,
                659
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "f〔邻之厚，君之薄也〕邻国的势力雄厚了，您秦国的势力（就）相对削弱了。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                658,
                478,
                690
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g〔若舍郑以为东道主〕如果（您）放弃（围攻）郑国而把它作为东方道路上（招待过客）的主人。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                690,
                478,
                724
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "m〔既东封郑〕在东边使郑国成为它的边境之后。封，疆界，这里用作动词。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                498,
                902,
                530
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "n〔肆其西封〕扩张它西边的疆界。意思是，晋国灭了郑国以后，必将进攻秦国。肆，延伸、扩张。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                531,
                902,
                563
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o〔阙（quē）秦〕使秦国土地减少。阙，侵损、削减。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                562,
                900,
                580
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "p〔将焉取之〕将从哪里取得它所贪求的土地呢？焉， 从哪里。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                579,
                902,
                609
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "q〔唯君图之〕希望您考虑这件事。唯，表示希望、祈请。之，指“阙秦以利晋”这件事。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                611,
                904,
                643
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "r〔杞子、逢（páng）孙、杨孙〕三人都是秦国的大夫。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                643,
                902,
                675
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "s〔子犯〕晋国大夫狐偃（晋文公的舅舅），字子犯。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                675,
                892,
                692
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h〔行李〕外交使者。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                107,
                722,
                263,
                739
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "t〔公〕指晋文公。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                532,
                690,
                673,
                707
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔共（gōng）其乏困〕供给他们缺少的资粮。共，同“供”，供给。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                107,
                739,
                478,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "u〔微夫（fú）人之力不及此〕没有那个人的力量，我是到不了这个地位的。晋文公曾在外流亡十九年，得到秦穆公的帮助才回到晋国做了国君。微，没有。夫人，那个人，指秦穆公。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                707,
                902,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔尝为晋君赐矣〕曾经给予晋君恩惠。为，给予。赐，恩惠。这里指秦穆公曾派兵护送晋惠公回国的事。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                771,
                478,
                819
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "v〔因人之力而敝之，不仁〕依靠别人的力量，又反过来损害他，这是不仁义的。因，依靠。敝，损害。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                771,
                902,
                803
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "k〔许君焦、瑕〕（晋惠公）答应给您焦、瑕这两个地方。焦、瑕，均在今河南三门峡一带。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                819,
                478,
                852
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "w〔失其所与，不知（zhì）〕失掉自己的同盟者，这是不明智的。与，结交、同盟。知，同“智”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                803,
                902,
                835
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l〔朝济而夕设版焉〕指晋惠公早上渡过黄河回国，晚上就修筑防御工事。济，渡河。设版，修筑防御工事。版，指版筑的工事。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                852,
                478,
                901
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "x〔以乱易整，不武〕用混乱相攻取代和谐一致，这是不符合武德的。武，指使用武力时所应遵守的道义准则。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                835,
                904,
                883
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "y〔吾其还也〕我们还是回去吧。其，表示祈使。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                883,
                857,
                901
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第一单元"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                796,
                939,
                862,
